  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-EC_NEAR" secondary-reporter="0" type="15">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Commission - Directorate-General for Neighbourhood and Enlargement Negotiations</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Development and implementation of software solution for the Ministry of Justice, Montenegro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the project is the setting up of an&amp;nbsp;integrated system which should ensure centralisation and efficient organisation of data, define standards for their input, generate reports and records, and transparent structure of processes and data flows within and between institutions, which would allow further upgrading and enhancement of Judicial Information System (JIS)&lt;a href=&quot;#_ftn1&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[1]&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objective &lt;a href=&quot;https://webgate.ec.testa.eu/mwp/#_ftn2&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[2]&lt;/a&gt; of this project is the development and implementation of integrated software solution of all subsystems which are an integral part of the responsibilities of each Ministry of Justice organisational unit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;a href=&quot;#_ftnref1&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[1]&lt;/a&gt; The Judicial Information System (JIS) will consist of four basic subsystems:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Subsystem for the Ministry of Justice&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Administration for Implementation of criminal sanctions (AICS)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Judiciary Subsystem - includes the Judicial Council and Montenegrin courts of all jurisdictions, except the Constitutional Court and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Subsystem for the State Prosecutor&apos;s Office - includes the Prosecutorial Council and Montenegrin State Prosecutor&apos;s Offices of all competencies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_ftnref2&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[2]&lt;/a&gt; The global and specific objectives shall clarify that all EU funded actions must promote the cross-cutting objectives of the EC: environment and climate change, rights-based approach, persons with disability, indigenous peoples and gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
